<title>ICELAND: Iceland June air cargo throughput down 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Iceland June air cargo throughput down 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland's international airport at Keflavik handled 1,628 tonnes of freight in June, a 4.3 percent fall over the same month a year earlier, Iceland's civil aviation administration said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>						    June 1997     June 1996</p>
<p>KEFLAVIK INT'L AIRPORT</p>
<p> Cargo export (in tonnes)			  913	     972</p>
<p>	 import					  715	     729</p>
<p> Total						 1,628	   1,701</p>
<p> Mail export (in tonnes)			    36		36</p>
<p>	import					   111	     111</p>
<p> Total						   147	     147</p>
<p> Passengers					124,149	 121,569</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
